J. Flower;
a demonstration of cookery and electrical appliances,
with emphasis on refrigerators, by Miss Hawes, SEEB;
and visited Nestle's factory. Woolwich visited Carreras new factory at Basildon;
the Milk Processing department of the United Dairies
where they saw interesting films before touring the
plant; the Deleware Farm; and, with members from
Canterbury and SE London Branches, toured the
National Maritime Museum and the Royal Naval
College.
